          "url": "https://github.com/duckdb/extension-ci-tools/blob/8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994/README.md#L12-L15"
        },
        {
          "commit": "8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994",
          "git_sha": "adddd33f4e40406dab78b2a9706aa7af9600cad3",
          "line_end": 24,
          "line_start": 17,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "duckdb/extension-ci-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/duckdb/extension-ci-tools/blob/8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994/README.md#L17-L24"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6e4d68fc51e1e04148d0bc52e8d8363977efe051b009ef16adbe5ae87e0cc989",
        "slc_d1ecd9f94dbcc71a12703bd4e06b8f1db12d7dbb514ae7930e9029f12960497d"
      ],
      "text": "It exposes reusable GitHub Actions workflows such as _submodule_version.yml and _extension_distribution.yml that extension repositories invoke with 'uses: duckdb/extension-ci-tools/...'."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_49f704eeb0d9b9a90ad308cd35a3ab921995ef1e8e05be2b18173556b4b9286e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994",
          "git_sha": "adddd33f4e40406dab78b2a9706aa7af9600cad3",
          "line_end": 24,
          "line_start": 17,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "duckdb/extension-ci-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/duckdb/extension-ci-tools/blob/8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994/README.md#L17-L24"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d1ecd9f94dbcc71a12703bd4e06b8f1db12d7dbb514ae7930e9029f12960497d"
      ],
      "text": "The _extension_distribution workflow accepts inputs including duckdb_version, ci_tools_version and extension_name, with duckdb_version fed from the submodule-version job's output."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c8301ed2f4185ff103918a501c63bf8eef7fb0148942c1c62ac8bd555a6d3d05",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994",
          "git_sha": "adddd33f4e40406dab78b2a9706aa7af9600cad3",
          "line_end": 27,
          "line_start": 26,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "duckdb/extension-ci-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/duckdb/extension-ci-tools/blob/8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994/README.md#L26-L27"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_bbb95eb8a3855505f38a1ff2b9e08f722d7b620805f0a131bf4be70fba674c1d"
      ],
      "text": "The submodule-version workflow accepts a submodule_path input that defaults to 'duckdb' and can be set to resolve a different submodule."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_11e1922f20ee797131209d767d7333c239c3f4c95bd42d49ddc9f93844d45b67",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994",
          "git_sha": "adddd33f4e40406dab78b2a9706aa7af9600cad3",
          "line_end": 27,
          "line_start": 26,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "duckdb/extension-ci-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/duckdb/extension-ci-tools/blob/8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994/README.md#L26-L27"
        },
        {
          "commit": "8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994",
          "git_sha": "adddd33f4e40406dab78b2a9706aa7af9600cad3",
          "line_end": 10,
          "line_start": 8,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "duckdb/extension-ci-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/duckdb/extension-ci-tools/blob/8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994/README.md#L8-L10"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_bbb95eb8a3855505f38a1ff2b9e08f722d7b620805f0a131bf4be70fba674c1d",
        "slc_d8bbaf607acb65829a63bc78b0e9fe8f951be4d493cd83278fd006769bb32945"
      ],
      "text": "The _submodule_version workflow makes the vendored DuckDB submodule the single source of truth for the version, so bumping the submodule is the only action that moves CI."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_78ca9928c3e6d330d2e96098ec1c3dfd9b205e961d2c80f2bdd360247afb8ea3",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994",
          "git_sha": "adddd33f4e40406dab78b2a9706aa7af9600cad3",
          "line_end": 32,
          "line_start": 29,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "duckdb/extension-ci-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/duckdb/extension-ci-tools/blob/8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994/README.md#L29-L32"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3e3d11b905f84cb20869ae5e66e71e4370571f692d70601916d6ace9a9c3d26c"
      ],
      "text": "Passing an empty duckdb_version also builds whatever the submodule points at, but loses the version in artifact names and ccache keys, which the submodule-version workflow preserves."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fa4be3aebef193acf831fc5152163ace14b285fdeaf35156ebe5c6c5480628be",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994",
          "git_sha": "adddd33f4e40406dab78b2a9706aa7af9600cad3",
          "line_end": 10,
          "line_start": 8,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "duckdb/extension-ci-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/duckdb/extension-ci-tools/blob/8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994/README.md#L8-L10"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d8bbaf607acb65829a63bc78b0e9fe8f951be4d493cd83278fd006769bb32945"
      ],
      "text": "Extensions vendor DuckDB as a git submodule and normally pass a duckdb_version literal to workflows, keeping the two in sync by hand unless the submodule-resolution workflow is used."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_104052cd48530dba26b10fbc924c2b1b379beaa6e0bd0c9c9ffdf46ea07e2308",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994",
          "git_sha": "adddd33f4e40406dab78b2a9706aa7af9600cad3",
          "line_end": 48,
          "line_start": 35,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "duckdb/extension-ci-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/duckdb/extension-ci-tools/blob/8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994/README.md#L35-L48"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6816cc1a51819aafe5b4d7a42aa937b385c23cbca439de49e5e0f2e37de704a2"
      ],
      "text": "Each branch of the repository targets a specific DuckDB version (e.g. main targets main, v1.4.4 targets v1.4.4), with a table indicating which branches are actively maintained."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_02c7c85b764f82551e3be1c1f76199e4a895b004381ecf913f5ccd010b6d21cd",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994",
          "git_sha": "adddd33f4e40406dab78b2a9706aa7af9600cad3",
          "line_end": 51,
          "line_start": 50,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "duckdb/extension-ci-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/duckdb/extension-ci-tools/blob/8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994/README.md#L50-L51"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b937d9a76254b6912116145d776464f5db19010d7d09efd38a53ef5bd173d8e2"
      ],
      "text": "Support for older DuckDB versions will eventually be dropped; the maintainers currently aim to support the latest two DuckDB versions to ease extension developers' transitions."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9350d38132507e1d1b05e60f50176e371cc9a0c9fd30e2ddeb841e4685339e00",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "workflows",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994",
          "git_sha": "adddd33f4e40406dab78b2a9706aa7af9600cad3",
          "line_end": 51,
          "line_start": 50,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "duckdb/extension-ci-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/duckdb/extension-ci-tools/blob/8fd4bb14edb07f8ba82809355e683d3647544994/README.md#L50-L51"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b937d9a76254b6912116145d776464f5db19010d7d09efd38a53ef5bd173d8e2"
      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: maintained branches are continually updated so the build environment stays functional for their targeted DuckDB version."
    }
